<section class="gme-contracts" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">
   <div class="container">
      <h2 class="gme-contracts-heading">GME membership</h2>
      <p>GME's membership structure aims to attract a mix of local, regional and international market participants to
         the Exchange. To ensure transparency in the membership admissions process, the criteria for membership
         is contained in the GME Rulebook and applications for membership are reviewed by the GME Markets
         committee. In addition to meeting the GME membership criteria, all members need to be authorised,
         recognised or otherwise permitted by the Dubai Financial Services Authority (DFSA).
      </p>
      <p>The list of current members can be access through the table below</p>
      <div class="membership-tax">
         <div class="member-list-1">
            <div class="member-h-p-div">
               <h2 class="membership-heading">Interested in membership</h2>
               <h6 class="membership-text">GME currently offers Off-Floor Memberships and Clearing
                  Memberships.
               </h6>
            </div>
            <div class="button-div">
               <button onclick="scrollToDiv()" class="members-tax-button">READ MORE <img
                  style="width: 17px; height: 24px;"
                  src="/storage/app/media/scroll%202.gif" />
               </button>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="member-list">
            <div class="member-h-p-div">
               <h2 class="membership-heading">IRS Tax Revenue</h2>
               <h6 class="membership-text">All GME Members must complete and return to us one of the
                  IRS Forms.
               </h6>
            </div>
            <a class="button-div" href="irs-tax-revenue-forms">
               <button class="members-tax-button">
                  IRS Forms
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"
                     xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                     <path d="M12.1716 7.00002L6.8076 1.63601L8.2218 0.221802L16 8.00002L8.2218 15.7781L6.8076 14.3639L12.1716 9.00002H0V7.00002H12.1716Z"
                        fill="#CFAB7A" />
                  </svg>
               </button>
            </a>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
